    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d249">

                <pb facs="0315" n="299" sameAs="frus:frus1947v08/pg299"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">835.6363/12–1747: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Ambassador in Argentina</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic">Bruce</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic"
                        >to the Secretary of State
                    </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">confidential</hi>
                    </seg>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Buenos Aires</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1947-12-17T18:00:00-03:00">December 17,
                            1947—6 p.m.</date>
                    </dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>1462. Please advise Holman, president Standard Oil New Jersey, in conference this
                    morning with President Perón and Señor Bramuglia, Perón stated that he was ready
                    to make long term agreement with private oil companies which would enable them
                    increase their refining capacity, keep their proportionate share of the market,
                    and do necessary drilling on their properties. Upon return office, I immediately
                    informed Barbour of Standard and suggested he begin detailed negotiations
                    immediately. If things work out in accordance <pb facs="0316" n="300"
                        xml:id="pg300"/> Perón statement, oil business for private companies will be
                    in best shape it has been in years.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Bruce</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
